#: scenario:scenario_A3832915_2CD3_4509_9CB5_A5D2CEB1D45C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d45a56dc4c88a55278e03443db0b0afece00f8915767e5ee5c9544f50a9fdfdf
#. default-sha256: 1c955450d868183742a8e9f28a6fdf4bd8ae65b5bc4d3a5a470c4b7a5719ff94
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_A3832915_2CD3_4509_9CB5_A5D2CEB1D45C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫—nothing. ⟪k:1⟫He could not speak."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫—ma non disse niente. ⟪k:1⟫Non riusciva a parlare."

#: scenario:scenario_F3238D63_F0DF_4916_94E5_10AA2F5002F0
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 4cea644770c623e27fa02cdc36ac97591113efcaeae17d2dfc8ea3fc3b32f19e
#. default-sha256: bbe5a4cb43a102f9a28e000cb43c549d7030a8f662b25b663283bb4866371a35
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F3238D63_F0DF_4916_94E5_10AA2F5002F0"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫The silhouette hanging above him was certainly the White-Haired Girl’s. ⟪k:1⟫Or was it? ⟪k:2⟫"
"Because his next words were—"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫La sagoma che pendeva sopra di lui era sicuramente quella della Ragazza dai Capelli Bianchi. "
"⟪k:1⟫Oppure no? ⟪k:2⟫Perché le sue parole successive furono—"

#: scenario:scenario_71606EEB_9DAB_4875_B9AD_52E5AFA70C4E
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8a27581f81ff2189308075a80cd5a350026b373b400767ba5ca73a865c465f4c
#. default-sha256: 8329918daf3d5fe6b58fd9996013054004443f8a71ade8e1b188741f9f7c37f3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_71606EEB_9DAB_4875_B9AD_52E5AFA70C4E"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫G-⟪k:1⟫Get off me!"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫L-⟪k:1⟫Levati di dosso!"

#: scenario:scenario_F3473CBE_D848_48B2_B063_CD14C0C95CF2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 36e559653e5fa8ad1efe9e8a976460f850dcc5aa2513b46acca3477b15f4bc79
#. default-sha256: 5480909a1377f0d8dd385a2f22c9adcb4b91bc670c8c368c7ace87fefd084b67
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F3473CBE_D848_48B2_B063_CD14C0C95CF2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫He reflexively shoved the girl straddling him aside."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Spinse di riflesso la ragazza che gli stava sopra."

#: scenario:scenario_1A37FEE3_0439_4DDF_B367_E6B25F979DAF
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: aef75fdc905f7dd8703030dd92f084702d35057254cda96eb504a4b915eefbd1
#. default-sha256: d9eeb006b928ed8d797dc2348fbfe18f8f8e8c9f7074ee0e443343f002c180e8
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_1A37FEE3_0439_4DDF_B367_E6B25F979DAF"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫She rolled off the bed, landing on the cold floor, ⟪k:1⟫but slowly, gradually, she crawled "
"her way back toward him."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Questa cadde giù dal letto, atterrando sul pavimento freddo, ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ma poco a poco, "
"strisciò nuovamente verso di lui."

#: scenario:scenario_19CA1D14_E2F2_4A56_B339_D8285223D006
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: af593ee2a56f15796dce8def075416a0cf9aa118b849b04bbde8b5a3b0c6e8b0
#. default-sha256: 2a8eea17bf634dd8c37a50858e6f8d686d6b4ae93e48be705103cc96a0cc3c61
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_19CA1D14_E2F2_4A56_B339_D8285223D006"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That wasn’t very nice..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Non è stato molto carino..."

#: scenario:scenario_2B55BD27_3FD5_4A63_86AC_84FA9D2F569C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 312bf1c42d795076dafb4ccaf240f8c0500c07e70ab8c7168e8eb9889ed857bf
#. default-sha256: 5d84a4226d7199f11417dd9527bbd5374231a132bdd0415a56f42abc3fd7e289
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_2B55BD27_3FD5_4A63_86AC_84FA9D2F569C"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Veiled in darkness, she slowly lifted her head. ⟪k:1⟫And then—⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫there was another "
"flash of lightning.⟪k:4⟫"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Velata dall’oscurità, sollevò lentamente la testa.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫E poi—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫ci fu un altro "
"lampo.⟪k:5⟫"

#: scenario:scenario_AE6F7AD3_974C_4BEE_881E_691681260D1C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 818e4737685760c7e9207f9ba19a5212b712bd303ed396f813ce061765623a09
#. default-sha256: 1f05d31e1ed43c7e6c123d55e60aa75efed9c7232a71dd74ba3c9d801ba31308
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_AE6F7AD3_974C_4BEE_881E_691681260D1C"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫The heavy fabric of the curtains rustled, bolts of light streaming between the gaps."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Il fruscio del pesante tessuto delle tende... ⟪k:1⟫i bagliori di luce che filtravano "
"attraverso gli spazi vuoti."

#: scenario:scenario_E0BE2D06_DD56_40C9_863A_9A4AAF6A3D39
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: de49d7a2fd912a66c55f93751f933e3648dacc47532d8debe0ae174fbfa37c10
#. default-sha256: fc8fae11369c35f1d384a14a9cfdea6b51b72ef33cbc4b7154f2a68b5d9b087e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_E0BE2D06_DD56_40C9_863A_9A4AAF6A3D39"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Her flaxen irises glimmered. ⟪k:21⟫Though in the bluish-white light, they took "
"on a twinge of almost golden glow."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫⟪k:12⟫⟪k:13⟫⟪k:14⟫⟪k:15⟫⟪k:16⟫⟪k:17⟫"
"⟪k:18⟫⟪k:19⟫⟪k:20⟫Le sue iridi chiare brillavano. ⟪k:21⟫Nonostante la luce bianco-bluastra, "
"assumevano una tonalità quasi dorata."

#: scenario:scenario_96413F74_9E88_415D_9DEB_7741E6D711E4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6c6db6d2a92db69668bde1e0df616626677309005bd57b60c0bfcd231f5020ec
#. default-sha256: 2693d47fc74e34741a7bc0c5125f345ee39ce9174dcc356f2e016b19717dbae2
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_96413F74_9E88_415D_9DEB_7741E6D711E4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫No need to be so rough.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫This isn’t the first time she’s visited your bedchamber,"
"⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫is it, Mell?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non c’è bisogno di essere così brusco.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Non è la prima volta che lei viene a farti "
"visita nella tua stanza,⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫vero, Mell?"

#: scenario:scenario_F689B45C_AAEA_445E_B158_18D9E7B52AA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2f732bec4bce05590af5d79d349920548987a27e938bdd64be9a1ba16916a215
#. default-sha256: 2de7610e6315089e71344d040e8b78b915a99c6c37307dca57a0deb74b7827c4
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_F689B45C_AAEA_445E_B158_18D9E7B52AA2"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Or did I not kiss you the same way?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Tell me, how does she run her fingers across "
"your skin?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫What does she do when she nuzzles up to you?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Oppure non so baciare come lei?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Dimmi, in che modo scorreva le sue dita sul tuo "
"corpo?⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Cosa faceva quando si strofinava su di te?"

#: scenario:scenario_706E20D7_6B3F_44A1_A31B_28781913B2C8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9fc9f4809181e9918da912c8b9cda13b55908b80c94cc0e03a145e9681c49742
#. default-sha256: e49339fd326ac88cb54ad596b17ec2770e4a5c540c7a099cca3273d3a92b5df0
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_706E20D7_6B3F_44A1_A31B_28781913B2C8"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫S— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Stop— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Stop this madness, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Nellie!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫Wh-"
"⟪k:11⟫Why would you... ⟪k:12⟫Why would you do this?!"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫B— ⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Basta— ⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Ferma questa follia, ⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫Nellie!⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫P-"
"⟪k:11⟫Perché... ⟪k:12⟫Perché stai facendo una cosa simile?!"

#: scenario:scenario_0F60EA05_B15B_455C_9597_EE4D757E9178
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2e52fb1fa598a2d3037a59a0fef3a65312099d713bc4711e050b9b21327059f2
#. default-sha256: d2265b87d56d3dad5e7570127305f1006531b9c1811df2cddfa17f54f98ebb48
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0F60EA05_B15B_455C_9597_EE4D757E9178"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Because you like white hair, don’t you, Mell?⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫You like white hair, which is why you "
"fell for her, isn’t it?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Perché ti piacciono i capelli bianchi... ⟪k:1⟫non è così, Mell?⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Ti piacciono i "
"capelli bianchi, per questo ti sei innamorato di lei, no?"

#: scenario:scenario_6584834B_2B27_4C60_BECD_C69EC8D9FC5F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2ab70dd590eeb89c007ad76737a13be8f1e729113e26dea1c357f6de7d618847
#. default-sha256: a61819343be3cf7c45f3f263a1a5b048550218597fb1534a01e108b0a256c8f3
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_6584834B_2B27_4C60_BECD_C69EC8D9FC5F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahaha... ⟪k:1⟫So if I have white hair, then you’ll fall for me too.⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Then I can be "
"your princess again, dearest Mell."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ahahah... ⟪k:1⟫Quindi se io ho i capelli bianchi, ti innamorerai anche di me.⟪k:2⟫ Così "
"potrò tornare ad essere la tua principessa, mio caro Mell."

#: scenario:scenario_0581AAED_B219_4E76_9F4C_F759584F14B8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 83e73a1d37c6f8eb091be04fcb1efa04d29996bea6fa6191bd856153ed7a392c
#. default-sha256: 92d5e3a580f3a6fd36481facc08731dfd7030e177f2da18cc9c11b3021e97715
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_0581AAED_B219_4E76_9F4C_F759584F14B8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫What... ⟪k:1⟫What are you even talking about?"
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Di che... ⟪k:1⟫Di che cosa stai parlando?"

#: scenario:scenario_56C0EA79_04E3_4DF3_9393_D98EF0417E64
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: e2aeaa09848fe3601a5ad390301880aae00cf9b921fd4b2482aa0a6a7b6e7f93
#. default-sha256: 3252f40df0ff5baa89fcdc3f060d5c309354f2cf2f2de76590e6ce20db710312
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_56C0EA79_04E3_4DF3_9393_D98EF0417E64"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫He could not escape from her—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫from his sister’s piercing gaze. ⟪k:3⟫“Why?” “What "
"happened?” “How could she?”"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non riusciva a fuggire da lei—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫dallo sguardo penetrante di sua sorella. "
"⟪k:3⟫“Perché?”⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫ “Cos’è successo?”⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫ “Come può lei—?”"

#: scenario:scenario_88E87D89_205B_45F5_854A_3EED23556195
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cc30caab8fefa9a52b9d7791489c780c2da62058e3795a4121c7853a4d50e9ac
#. default-sha256: 199edbb3be747b1e8185994d4413a8c11c4cedd2c1c29f58e12dfe3d1562df8a
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_88E87D89_205B_45F5_854A_3EED23556195"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫Questions crashed into the young man’s mind like waves in a stormy sea."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le domande si infransero nella mente del giovane come onde di un mare in tempesta."

#: scenario:scenario_7E81027E_A71F_4178_9C1E_AC4E4ACCE1E3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8cd1778cb77d61642b8f0bdae743c3d41e32d12f7c2450cdbf136572bb06964d
#. default-sha256: 5d840af5c59b1bd5c08fc8d02c6e64f650fc84e2b41f9a9fc2e3ae957df8e70e
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_7E81027E_A71F_4178_9C1E_AC4E4ACCE1E3"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But none of them found answers; they simply caused him further perplexity."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Ma nessuna di queste trovò risposta; ⟪k:1⟫non facevano altro che renderlo ulteriormente "
"perplesso."

#: scenario:scenario_B003D897_E99E_4E93_A1AF_0E6168B74274
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 713619f6aaa0c62fcfb4c5bc0a6d51d5ff8ace978c49ee21d28f18d80b7b20b1
#. default-sha256: a543ef2a978b173f8725a50a4e67b84dd1755059722ae78f039ae17548f3b5d5
msgctxt "scenario:scenario_B003D897_E99E_4E93_A1AF_0E6168B74274"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Y-⟪k:1⟫Your hair...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫What happened to your hair?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫How did you... ⟪k:6⟫get it "
"that color?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫I tuoi—⟪k:1⟫ I tuoi capelli...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Cos’è successo ai tuoi capelli?⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Come "
"fanno... ⟪k:6⟫ad avere quel colore?"

#: scenario:scenario_F013A957_0815_4057_962E_7B318845C66F
