msgctxt "scenario:scenario_D0C97E4B_BC63_43D6_8DF6_E6C0054A7994"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫It never made sense to me!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Why would she hire a maid she knew nothing about,⟪k:3⟫"
"someone who just showed up at the door one day?"
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Non ha mai avuto senso per me!⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Perché avrebbe dovuto assumere una domestica di cui "
"non sapeva nulla—⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫una che si era appena presentata alla nostra porta?"

