msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫From a good house? Don’t make me laugh.⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫If she were ⟪k:3⟫really⟪k:4⟫ nobility, she "
"would have given us her name."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Da una buona famiglia? Ma non farmi ridere...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫Se fosse ⟪k:3⟫veramente⟪k:4⟫ una "
