msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Th-⟪k:1⟫That doesn’t make any sense...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫I don’t believe a word you’re saying.⟪k:4⟫"
"⟪k:5⟫It couldn’t possibly be true..."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫No... ⟪k:1⟫Non ha alcun senso...⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫Non credo a una sola parola di quello che stai "
"dicendo.⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫Non può essere vero..."

#: scenario:scenario_0D671DCA_8D23_4F5E_8454_F092A3B1CDD3
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c2f32935d06e2858e100463fe4f9dbb67570f4a56d11af2da6ce929c82322e02
